# Power-on screen, then the kid at the C64 types. Shot 1–2 of the video.
# .cps is characters per second. {typo:WRONG:RIGHT} mistypes, pauses, and corrects.
# {spade} and {heart} are PETSCII graphics from the uppercase/graphics set.
.cps 12
.hold 1.1
10 PRINT "HELLO."
.enter
.hold 0.15
20 PRINT "I AM YOUR COMPUTER."
.enter
.hold 0.2
30 PR{typo:ONT:INT} "I THINK IN BASIC."
.enter
.hold 0.35
RUN
.enter
.hold 0.25
HELLO.
.enter
I AM YOUR COMPUTER.
.enter
I THINK IN BASIC.
.enter
.hold 0.15
.ready
.hold 0.3
{spade} NOT WHAT WE THOUGHT {heart}
.enter
.hold 1.3
